	"apps/dflc/threecluesgame/i18n/i18n.properties":'# This is the resource bundle for apps.dflc.threecluesgame\n\n#Texts for manifest.json\n\n#XTIT: Application name\nappTitle=Jogo das 3 pistas\n\n#YDES: Application description\nappDescription=Jogo das tr\\u00eas pistas\n#XTIT: Main view title\ntitle=Jogo das 3 pistas\n\n#XFLD,60\nThreeCluesGame-show.flpTitle=Jogo das tr\\u00eas pistas\n\n#XFLD,33\nThreeCluesGame-show.flpSubtitle=Tr\\u00eas pistas\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Di\\u00e1logo: Como Jogar\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nhowToPlay.title=\\u2753 COMO JOGAR\nhowToPlay.aboutTitle=\\ud83c\\udfaf SOBRE O JOGO\nhowToPlay.aboutText=Desafio de adivinha\\u00e7\\u00e3o baseado no famoso programa de TV! O objetivo \\u00e9 descobrir a palavra secreta usando o menor n\\u00famero de dicas poss\\u00edvel.\n\nhowToPlay.scoreTitle=\\ud83c\\udfc6 PONTUA\\u00c7\\u00c3O DAS PISTAS\nhowToPlay.hint1=1\\u00aa Dica\nhowToPlay.hint1Pts=10 pts\nhowToPlay.hint2=2\\u00aa Dica\nhowToPlay.hint2Pts=9 pts\nhowToPlay.hint3=3\\u00aa Dica\nhowToPlay.hint3Pts=8 pts\n\nhowToPlay.rulesTitle=\\ud83d\\udcdc REGRAS DA RODADA\nhowToPlay.rule1=A roleta sorteia o envelope com a palavra secreta.\nhowToPlay.rule2=O jogador da vez recebe a dica e tem o tempo limite para responder.\nhowToPlay.rule3=Se errar ou o tempo acabar, a vez passa para o rival com a pr\\u00f3xima dica.\n\nhowToPlay.audienceTitle=\\ud83d\\udc65 A PLATEIA / AUDIT\\u00d3RIO\nhowToPlay.audienceRule1=Se os dois jogadores errarem ou o tempo esgotar nas 3 dicas, a vez vai para a Plateia!\nhowToPlay.audienceRule2=A Plateia pode tentar quantas respostas quiser ou pular a vez.\nhowToPlay.audienceRule3=Quando a vez chega na Plateia, o acerto vale sempre 10 PONTOS (mesmo pulando ou errando tentativas)!\n\nhowToPlay.tipText=Voc\\u00ea pode enviar seu pr\\u00f3prio arquivo .JSON com envelopes customizados!\nhowToPlay.btnGotIt=Entendi!',
	"apps/dflc/threecluesgame/i18n/i18n_en.properties":'# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Dialog: How To Play\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nhowToPlay.title=\\u2753 HOW TO PLAY\nhowToPlay.aboutTitle=\\ud83c\\udfaf ABOUT THE GAME\nhowToPlay.aboutText=A guessing game inspired by the classic TV show! The goal is to guess the secret word using as few clues as possible.\n\nhowToPlay.scoreTitle=\\ud83c\\udfc6 CLUE SCORING\nhowToPlay.hint1=1st Clue\nhowToPlay.hint1Pts=10 pts\nhowToPlay.hint2=2nd Clue\nhowToPlay.hint2Pts=9 pts\nhowToPlay.hint3=3rd Clue\nhowToPlay.hint3Pts=8 pts\n\nhowToPlay.rulesTitle=\\ud83d\\udcdc ROUND RULES\nhowToPlay.rule1=The wheel spins to pick an envelope with the secret word.\nhowToPlay.rule2=The current player receives the clue and has a time limit to answer.\nhowToPlay.rule3=If they guess wrong or time runs out, the turn passes to the rival with the next clue.\n\nhowToPlay.audienceTitle=\\ud83d\\udc65 THE AUDIENCE\nhowToPlay.audienceRule1=If both players fail or time runs out after 3 clues, it goes to the Audience!\nhowToPlay.audienceRule2=The Audience can try as many answers as they want or skip the turn.\nhowToPlay.audienceRule3=When it reaches the Audience, a correct answer is ALWAYS worth 10 POINTS (even after skipping or wrong attempts)!\n\nhowToPlay.tipText=You can upload your own custom .JSON file with custom envelopes!\nhowToPlay.btnGotIt=Got it!',
